    ],
    "summary": "When the only bearers of a [keyword](vsdata:core-rule/keywords-in-attached-units) in an **Attached Unit** are **destroyed**, the combined unit loses that keyword. If the Aspiring Sorcerer was the only **PSYKER** in a Rubric Marines unit, its destruction removes **PSYKER** from the unit.",
